    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda Giiduupcheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, iing'ata miyeeda orjooga asiyeenya bea Haruni, damanda neekiisiina madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gameewa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Eeshiina orjeeda geamadu was Haruni adagoona damanyoojiga sean heeda ghaydit was beashooda, was madeeda hoorgeeda baydeayda mida uhuuda sandaku, aba gideaba gajiidu ghami; aba gideaba gaydabareanu aba jeeda shamooghooda aba badayda hoorgeeda baydeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Haruni geaghus ghwaan heeda ghaydit: nea gweadu jurukuta mwanang' jea ghaghadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda ea lagweenda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygooshuup geaw gooteeda bumbun ghaydit, ak gaygwandeawa suruwaleeda bumbun aba saseadaanyi, ak gajeerasa ghealooda bumbun, ak gooshuup ngoofajeanda bumbun; suh hang'weaka ghaydidi. Ak gaygoohuun saseadaanyi aba beega, amang'ata gooshuup geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygageanu aba jeeda fuga Israeli ghwaray iyeenya was haleanjeeda jea eaghadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda, ea lagweenjeanjagi was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gayghoadayda Haruni jurukuta ghoah haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda aba badaydaanyi, ak gaygwasin giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi ea dea fugeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygageanu noosu asiyeenyean, ak ghwayiin madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba gidaghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoalalaat Haruni nooga asiyeenya, akaleala oolealeasa NG'UTAMIIDA nea niirja gwaloosa meang'nyeandeenda was Asaseli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygageanu Haruni mbooyda loosa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoadayda ghoah haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea mbooyda abissa ng'archeanda aba badayda Asaseli gajeatayda nea majeek aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwasin giiduupcheeda aba badayda, ak abeeda geayaat dareapcheeda heeda Asaseli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gayghoadayda Haruni jurukuta ghoah haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda aba badaydaanyi, ak gwasin giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi niny ea gheanyi; gaygwanuus jurukuta ghoah haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygageanu gidasimikiisiinda nea ghwanyiit rarayga beasta leabu heeda wagiida aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea geediga ng'andidi sing'aal muuchi nyiit baneaguuk iyeenya; ak gweadu heeda ghaydit muuchi was jeeda beashooda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwayiin geediga ng'andidi jeeda beasta aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak abeeda gwadukuta aroosta geediga ng'andidi hoorgeeda mida badayda sandakwajeanda, ak ea mwami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygageanda foojeanda mwaatkwa bea jurukuta, ak ghwasakta aba mooneadaanyi madeeda hoorgeeda baydeayda, nea murdeeda hoorgeeda baydeayda gaygwasaksa foojeanda aba mooneadaanyi niba ispwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaygwanuus mbooyda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda aba badahuuka buuneeda, ak gweadu foojeandaanyi jeeda beashooda, ak gwahinda foojeandaanyi gidahinda foojeanda jurukuta, ak gwasaksa badayda hoorgeeda baydeayda ea madeeda hoorgeeda baydeayda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amang'ata gaygwasin giiduupcheeda heeda ghaydit, aba badayda ririnnyeanda fuga Israeli, ea badayda giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa, ea riing'eega nyaawa sean; ak gaygwasin eara aba maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, mideawa aba bugusta ririnnyeanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maygwanda siida jea goobiida jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa damanda beawa gwasin giiduupcheeda aba heeda ghaydit ea gwardu jarooda nea nisin giiduupcheadaanyi niny ea gheanyi ea dea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygwarita jarooda heeda wagiida mida madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwasissa giiduupcheeda, ak gaygageanu foojeanda mwaatkwa bea jurukuta ea foojeanda mbooyda, ak ghwayiin murdajeega heeda wagiida nea gooneaweesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gayghwasakta foojeanda mwaatkwa aba mooneadaanyi niba ispwa, ak ghoamiidu nea ghoaghaydiit aba ririnnyeanda fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida siitawi munyinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iidu nea niihiit giiduupcheeda heeda ghaydit ea dea maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa ea heeda wagiida, hean gayghoadayda mbooyda majeek; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwayiin Haruni geatingaaschi duwaawi uhuuda mbooyda majeek, ak gwaduukuuna aba badayda siida ea giidiinyeannyeeka sean bea fuga Israeli, ea ramaseannyeeka nyaawa sean, ea riing'eega nyaawa sean, ak ghwayiin sean uhuuda mbooyda, ak ghwanung' gawa dareapcheeda aba geatinda siida siloat gwasin gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mbooyda gayghwasar munyasnacheeka nyaawa ea ghoahiita dareapcheeda; ak gaygwasiksa mbooyda gawa dareapcheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata gaygawa Haruni jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghafwakta hang'weaka bumbuni akwa damanda beawa heeda ghaydit, ak gwanung'usa hoowa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygoohuun saseadaanyi aba jeeda beega aba heeda ghaydit, ak gookwa hang'weakaaschi, ak gwardu ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea buuneeda, ak gwasin giiduupcheeda aba badaydaanyi niny ea aba badahuuka buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghashneeda gidasighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda gayghaghwarda aba heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida siksa mbooyda gawa heeda Asaseli gaygoohuun hang'weakaaschi nea goohuun saseadaanyi aba beega, ak abeeda ghoamu gawa jeeda maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jurukuta sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda sea mbooyda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda, was dea siyeadu foojeandaanyi ak geesina giiduupcheeda aba heeda ghaydit, ak geeruuteawa jeeda mujiini; nea muuchka nyaawa ea banyeega nyaawa ea heelga nyaawa gajeaghwarda aba beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda siida ghwarda haleanjeeni gaygoohuun hang'weakaaschi nea goohuun saseadaanyi aba jeeda beega, amang'ata gayghoan jeeda maheemajeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Furdeayda eaweeda giiduupcheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gayghoah deaweeda aba heedeang'wa eaweega manda muudeanooda nea aba sheedeaba ispwa, eaweeteaba damanamughuush bea sheeda, gajarada jalooda, ak ea majasna gadiyeeda, adea siideaba ng'eang'i gil ghanea rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba eaweecheanji gajeesin giiduupcheeda aba badahuukeagwa, ak geamiineegwa; aba riing'eegeagwa sean ak gajawoosa miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih sabaato gil jea afuufana, nea ghoarachi jalooda; nih deaweeda gil ea ghoah eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ashoohoocheanda simwaar ak gealoat ghoah ashoohoocheanda ghoaghiis hoorgeeda ghwaan gaygwasin giiduupcheeda, nea gookwa hang'weaka ghaydidi bumbuni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygwasin giiduupcheeda heeda ghaydit muuchi, ak gwasin giiduupcheeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa ea dea heeda wagiida, ak gaygwasin giiduupcheeda aba badahuuka ashoohoodiga ea badahuuka buuneesean bwatgeat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda nih gayghoah deaweeda aba heedeang'wa eaweega manda muudeanooda, gajeesin giiduupcheeda nibwagi aba badahuuka fuga Israeli aba jeeda gweayda aba badahuuka riing'eega nyaawa sean.” Ak gwasinda Musa gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
